{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1474070-module-about-sexphobic-mage","id":1474070,"title":"Module about sexphobic Mage?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-06T02:38:13-08:00","id":1474070,"title":"Module about sexphobic Mage?","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">One supplement for </span></span></span><i><a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/TabletopGame/MageTheAwakening\" target=\"_blank\">Mage: The Awakening</a></i><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> features a town where a mage with strong ideas on wholesomeness and youth morality created a working that would keep teenagers away from sex, </span></span></span><i>especially</i><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> &quot;aberrant&quot; forms of sex such as homosexuality or kink. The good news is, it's worked, as most of the youth have sublimated their sexual desires into other hobbies. The </span></span></span><i>bad</i><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> news is if they ever give in to their sexual desires outside of the context of heterosexual marriage, it's a sin against the </span></span></span><a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/KarmaMeter\" target=\"_blank\">Karma Meter</a><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> \u2014 with premarital sex being as bad as manslaughter, and homosexual or kinky sex being as bad as </span></span></span><i>torture</i><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">. Which mea